{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫全新旅遊節目《Grand住去首爾》，由高海寧、周嘉洛及朱敏瀚擔任主持，帶觀眾往韓國首爾體驗極致的吃喝玩樂，包括米芝蓮星級美食、打卡人氣熱點及奢華酒店等。</p><p>節目將由10月31日起、一連三個星期六晚8點翡翠台播映。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:13.903962+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:50:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:12.616929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:13.903962+00:00","content_hash":"1544c32f285b9c40d14c9b84a17493c0204d11e6fc237d3174f9da2ab7cb0b31","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}